      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h4><strong>Code of Conduct</strong></h4> <p>The Code of Conduct for ZOLLER and our subsidiaries can be found here:</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/01_Pages/Company/Compliance/CoC_f%C3%BCr_MA_EN.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download Code of Conduct</a></p> <h4><strong>Code of Conduct for Business Partners</strong></h4> <p>Our business partners make a significant contribution to our success. Therefore, a common understanding of ethical and lawful conduct forms the foundation of our business relationships. The requirements and principles of the following \"Code of Conduct for Business Partners\" are an essential part of the cooperation between ZOLLER and our business partners.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/01_Pages/Company/Compliance/CoC_f%C3%BCr_Gesch%C3%A4ftspartner_EN.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download Code of Conduct for Business Partners</a></p> <h4><strong>Whistleblower system at ZOLLER</strong></h4> <p>An internal reporting office has been set up for ZOLLER employees, which you can use to report possible compliance violations to us confidentially and, if you wish, anonymously. Please contact the ombudsman with your report:</p> <p>Lawyer Dr. Jochen Bernhard<br/>Menold Bezler Rechtsanwälte Steuerberater Wirtschaftsprüfer Partnerschaft mbB<br/>E-mail: ZOLLER@menoldbezler.de<br/>Telephone: (0711) 860 40 611<br/>Postal address: Stresemannstraße 79, <br/>70191 Stuttgart</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
